      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s1w0",
          "text": "One factor people often underestimate is their own documentation, which is why a consistent pain journal detailing day-to-day struggles and disruptions gives attorneys concrete material that adjusters find considerably harder to dispute than a medical record alone.",
